Brine-Jive

Ingredients: DARKWAVE & COLDWAVE + EUPHORIC, ENERGETIC & JOLLY + BARKING DUCK (ELECTRO SWING FUNK)  
Creative Catalyst: Reverse-engineered from a corrupted chrome cassette unearthed from a submerged 1984 harbor municipality time capsule.

Brine-Jive sounds like a bleak 1980s post-punk cellar party violently invaded by a rollicking 1930s speakeasy brass band, driven by rubbery slap-bass bounce and the manic, duck-call quacks of vintage envelope-filtered funk synths. It marries the frostbitten drum machines, chorus-drenched baritone guitars, and brooding minor-key angst of coldwave with the irrepressibly joyful, high-kicking four-on-the-floor swing of electro swing funk.

