- Harmonic Palette: Somber Dorian and Aeolian coldwave modal progressions punctuated by sharp, unexpected major-6th horn stabs and brassy flat-five blues resolutions.
- Production Signatures: 
  1. The Salted Slap: An aggressive, chorus-drenched Fender Bass VI running post-punk arpeggios that suddenly trade bars with funk-slapped thumb bass.
  2. The Mallard Choke: Formant-filtered talkbox synthesis and wah-pedal brass chops ("barking duck" quacks) ducking in and out of icy, long-tail digital plate reverbs.
